## 6. Caddyfile

```caddyfile
{
    on_demand_tls {
        ask http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/internal/check-domain
        interval 2m
        burst 5
    }
    email admin@hanghoaphaisinh.net
    log { output file C:/caddy/logs/caddy.log { roll_size 10mb; roll_keep 3; roll_keep_for 7d } }
}

crm.hanghoaphaisinh.net {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080 { header_up Host {host}; ... }
}

:443 {
    tls { on_demand }
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080 { ... }
}
```

**Bắt buộc:** `header_up Host {host}` — backend dùng Host header để định tuyến multi-domain. Thiếu → mọi request về `/`.

**Nên thêm** (đang thiếu, gây 502 khi backend restart):
```caddyfile
reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080 {
    header_up Host {host}
    lb_try_duration 10s
    lb_try_interval 500ms
    lb_try_count 5
    health_uri /health
    health_interval 30s
}
```

**Cấu hình Caddy cho Linux** (`deploy/caddy/Caddyfile`) phải tương đương bản Windows.

